			<div class="content" id="post-content-3878227">
									

<p>At first I thought this was weird-for-weird's-sake, but there's something else going on here. There's a desolate, slightly sad weirdness to the whole business, and particularly the descriptions of the vendors. It feels oddly frustrated and dissipated, as if they're all stuck somewhere in a transitional purgatory of shit bootlegs and crappy merchandise, shifting stock endlessly, but to what end? This was mirrored quite nicely by the documentation, which seems like it has no idea what to make of this oddly gathering and brings up things that should be mentioned, like the 'History' addendum, only for there not really to be anything to say.</p>
<p>I kind of want Tales about these guys, which doesn't happen often. +1</p>

